      "updatedAt": "2026-11-08"
    },
    {
      "id": "6afac1f3f17f6280b0c116c0",
      "projectId": "6afac1f3f17f6280b0c1168b",
      "name": "Interview protocol",
      "kind": "document",
      "ext": "md",
      "bytes": 261,
      "tags": [
        "research"
      ],
      "description": "Protocol and consent process.",
      "status": "Final",
      "version": 3,
      "body": "# Interview protocol\n\n## Before the session\n1. Confirm consent\n2. Explain that the session is recorded\n\n## Questions\n- What color do you remember from that day?\n- What did it feel like?\n\n## After the session\nSend the transcript to the participant within a week.",
      "isDoc": true,
      "isFinal": true,
      "requirementIds": [
        "6afac1f3f17f6280b0c116ae"
      ],
      "taskIds": [],
      "milestoneId": "6afac1f3f17f6280b0c11695",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-30"
    },
    {
      "id": "6afac1f3f17f6280b0c116bd",
      "projectId": "6afac1f3f17f6280b0c11689",
      "name": "Style guide",
      "kind": "document",
      "ext": "md",
      "bytes": 288,
      "tags": [
        "style"
      ],
      "description": "Voice, visual rules, and naming.",
      "status": "Final",
      "version": 2,
      "body": "# Style guide\n\n## Voice\nWarm, concrete, and a little playful. Prefer short sentences.\n\n## Visual rules\n- Solid colors, no gradients\n- One accent color per scene\n- Characters are always outlined\n\n## Naming\nUse the spelling in the character bible. When unsure, decide once and note it here.",
      "isDoc": true,
      "isFinal": true,
      "requirementIds": [
        "6afac1f3f17f6280b0c116aa"
      ],
      "taskIds": [],
      "milestoneId": "6afac1f3f17f6280b0c11690",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-15"
    },
